# Generated pipeline artifacts
PROMPTS/*.txt
# NOTE: on macOS (case-insensitive filesystem) the PROMPTS/*.txt rule also
# matches the lowercase prompts/ template directory. The tracked detection
# templates under prompts/ (world_cup_detection_prompt.txt,
# basketball_detection_prompt.txt, thumbnail_prompt_template.txt) are committed
# with `git add -f` and must stay tracked.
DETECTION/
DETECTIONS/
CLIP_MANIFESTS/*.csv
